5
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:05,450
Be happy! 弛まず目指せよ
Be happy! Steadfastly aim for it,

6
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:06,650
アンデッド！生きているんだね
Undead! You're truly alive, aren't you?

7
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,850
目を逸らした過去も
Both the past you averted your eyes from,

8
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,950
退屈な未来も
and the tedious future,

9
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,150
カウンセリング
be it counseling,

10
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,300
古今東西 ピースピース
or peace signs across all times and places!

11
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:15,350
Unhappy?

12
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:16,850
Unlucky?

13
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Be happy!

14
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,500
アンデッド！アンデッド！
Undead! Undead!

15
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,500
ねえ ねえ ねえ
Hey, hey, hey...

16
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,900
何だかどうして戦ってるようなそんな気がするの
Why does it feel like I'm somehow in a battle?

17
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:33,700
触れられない 触れたくもない
Unable to touch, or even wanting to touch,

18
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:37,350
もうとっくに死んでる 透明な亡霊と対決
Confronting a transparent ghost that died long, long ago,

19
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:40,000
幼気で痛い記憶の奥
deep within tender yet aching memories.

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,300
残念？もう居ないのに
A disappointment? Even though she's no longer here...

21
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:44,200
あれ？そっちが良い？アイロニーね
Huh? What an irony that it's actually preferred,

22
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,300
透かされているのは現在の自分？
or is it my present self being seen right through?

23
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,800
ナンセンス 消えないレッテル Yes! 要はコンプレックス
Nonsense, an indelible label—yes, in short, a complex.

24
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:54,400
取り憑かれているみたい 巻き付いたまま
It's like I'm possessed, tightly coiled around me,

25
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:58,900
まだ離れない 在りし日の自分
still unable to let go of who I used to be.

26
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,400
アンデッド！
Undead!

27
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:03,200
死んじゃいない お前とお前の連鎖
You're not dead—a chain reaction between you and yourself.

28
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:07,000
生きていることとは変わり続けることだ
To be alive is to keep changing.

29
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,900
不幸に甘んじて 満足するなよ
Don't settle for misfortune and be satisfied!

30
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:13,800
幸せになろうとしないなんて卑怯だ
Not even trying to find happiness is just cowardly.

31
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,300
この世この世は 奇怪奇怪ファンタジー
This world, this world is a bizarre, strange fantasy.

32
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:20,500
次は鬼が出るか蛇が出るか
Will a demon or a serpent appear next?

33
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:24,000
出会って遭ってやっと始まる物語
A story that finally begins when we meet and encounter fate.

34
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,400
さあ人か化物か 閑話休題 ピースピース
Come now, human or monster? All aside, peace, peace!

35
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:30,300
Past and future can't change the past

36
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:33,300
Past and future, run for the future

37
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:35,300
カッ カッ カットイン 何だかどうして
Cut, cut, cut in—why does it feel like...

38
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:40,200
未来になんぞ何の希望もない 期待出来ないような気がして
...there's no hope or expectation whatsoever for the future?

39
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:44,200
もう随分生きている 既視感とテンプレで食傷
Having lived so long, I'm sick of the déjà vu and clichés,

40
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,400
素敵な出来事の気配もない
without a trace of any wonderful event.

41
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:51,300
残念 積んだ経験の因果 形骸化された神話と退屈な進化
A disappointment? The karma of accumulated experience, hollowed-out myths, and boring evolution.

42
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:53,900
要は刺激が欲しいんだ 飽きちゃった
In short, I just want excitement—I got bored,

43
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:57,400
なんて 整っていくガイダンス 増えるコンプライアンス
as guidance is refined and compliance grows.

44
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:00,800
蓋されていくみたい 吸い尽くして
It feels like the lid is closing in—suck it all dry.

45
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:05,600
あれもこれもどれも 同じ味がする
This, that, and everything else tastes the exact same.

46
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,400
アンデッド！
Undead!

47
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:10,500
死んじゃいない お前とお前の連鎖
You're not dead—a chain reaction between you and yourself.

48
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:14,300
何時の世も過去も未来も現在にあるんだ
In every era, the past and future both exist in the present!

49
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:18,800
生きていることを 愚直に果たせよ 目指せハッピーエンド
Fulfill living with foolish sincerity—aim for a happy ending!

50
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,500
アンデッド！
Undead!

51
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:23,200
死んじゃいない お前に言っているんだ
I'm talking to you, the one who isn't dead!

52
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:26,900
幸せを諦めてしまうな 人で在れ
Don't give up on happiness—stay human!

53
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:30,800
ただ苦しみに慣れて耐えているだけじゃ
Just getting used to suffering and enduring it...

54
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:34,400
死んでいるも同然 屍のアンデッド
...is no different from being dead—a corpse-like undead.

55
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,700
悩める人の子よ
O, troubled children of mankind,

56
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,800
人成らざる者も
and those who are not human as well,

57
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,900
Be happy! 弛まず目指せよ
Be happy! Steadfastly aim for it,

58
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:41,200
アンデッド！生きているんだろ
Undead! You're alive, aren't you?

59
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,300
不幸に浸るも
Whether wallowing in misfortune,

60
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:45,700
幸せになるのも そう全部全部お前だ
or finding happiness, yes, it's all up to you!

61
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:49,000
古今東西 一切合切 森羅万象 ピースピース
Across all times and places, absolutely everything in creation, peace, peace!

62
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Past and future can't change the past

63
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,200
Past and future, run for the future

64
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,000
人の在る所に
Wherever humans exist,

65
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,700
何時も憂い事
